div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$0</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Pickaxe</b> is an admin <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Tools\" title=\"Category:Tools\">tool</a> obtainable only by using a Spawn Menu. Like the name implies, it's a tool used for ease of testing for mining. It has maxed out stats, capable of one-shotting most ore veins in the game, having no charge and 50 studs of range.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Pickaxe</b> is a medium sized pick with a glossy pink headpiece and pearly white handle. Headpiece is pink in color with the default legacy foil material applied to it. Handle is colored white, using the default legacy wood material.\n</p><p>It's model appears to derived from the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Pickaxe\" title=\"Rusty Pickaxe\">Rusty Pickaxe</a>, minus the improvised grip.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9231a6f8d8a1540de7ffa6abe0c9b9c2\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Admin_Pickaxe_GC-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:155px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Admin_Pickaxe_GC.png\" title=\"Admin Pickaxe GC.png (52 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:155px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/85/Admin_Pickaxe_GC.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/155?cb=20230719150147\" title=\"Admin Pickaxe GC.png (52 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Admin Pickaxe GC.png\" data-image-key=\"Admin_Pickaxe_GC.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Admin Pickaxe GC.png (52 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Admin Pickaxe GC.png\" data-image-key=\"Admin_Pickaxe_GC.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/85/Admin_Pickaxe_GC.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/155?cb=20230719150147\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:180px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png\" title=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png (88 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:180px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230719145545\" title=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png (88 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png\" data-image-key=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png (88 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png\" data-image-key=\"AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230719145545\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Early version of <b>Admin Pickaxe</b> used to have a decal of the internet meme \"Giga Chad\" plastered over it's headpiece. DevShurikeno used to have a special variant of the Admin Axe, with a decal of...Twitch streamer XQC morphed into a Pepe the frog holding a pink heart plastered over it's headpiece.</li>\n<li>Current design of <b>Admin Pickaxe</b> uses the design first introduced in older Oaklands iteration - Oaklands Legacy.</li>\n<li>It's stats are not representitive of it's actual power, as the description was copied over from <a href=\"/wiki/Admin_Axe\" title=\"Admin Axe\">Admin Axe</a>.</li>\n<li>It's description is a reference to a classic youtube video \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dgha9S39Y6M\">MINE DIAMONDS | miNECRAFT PARODY OF TAKE ON ME</a>\".</li>\n<li>The admin pickaxe as well as other admin tools are publicly usable in \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/14171339725/Oaklands-100-Players\">Oaklands 100 Players</a>\", however this game is rarely unlocked by the developers.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903162957\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 507/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 85/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2782/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019509/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.987      1 -total\n 94.89%   39.841      1 Template:Pickaxe\n  4.95%    2.077      1 Template:Unobtainable\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:289-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903162957 and revision id 14417. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Exclusive","Pickaxes","Admin_items"],"links":[{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Admin Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Category:Tools","exists":true}],"images":["Admin_Pickaxe.png","Admin_Pickaxe_Box.png","Admin_Pickaxe_GC.png","AdminPickaxe3rdTexture.png"]}
